Added opt-in `events_keys` value `"state_writes"` (not in `"*"`). Observers that set it receive a `state_writes` array on `POST /new_block`: every `(key, value)` the block wrote to the Clarity MARF, recorded at the storage layer, with the producing transaction's `tx_index` (or `null` for block-level writes) and a per-block `ordinal`. Collection is off unless an observer opts in. `GET /v3/blocks/replay/{block_id}` accepts `vm_events=1` and `state_writes=1` to return the same traces for a replayed block, and its transactions now report their position in the block as `tx_index`.
